<title>USA: Advanced Plant to pay 100 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Advanced Plant to pay 100 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Plant Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it will pay a one-for-one common stock dividend. The record date is November 15, and the pay date is November 25, said Chief Operating Officer Sam Berkowitz.</p>
<p>The company is developing drugs to treat AIDS, leukemia and general cancers. It is beginning Phase I-II studies in human clinical trials to test its AIDS drug, ABAVCA.</p>
</text>
